WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:16.920
These seven parallel Week Eight assignments explain mechanisms, development, airway care and pharmacology within the school’s pediatric and obstetric work. The other four required readings remain with their teaching sessions; all eleven belong to this week.
这七项并行的第8周指定阅读，解释学校儿科及产科学习中的机制、发育、气道照护及药理。另四项指定阅读保留在对应教学课内；十一项都属于本周。

00:00:16.920 --> 00:00:26.544
Anatomy and pathophysiology explain mechanisms. Fundamentals and mental-health nursing help adapt observation and communication.
解剖生理及病理生理解释机制；基础护理及精神护理帮助调整观察与沟通。

00:00:26.544 --> 00:00:38.088
Clinical procedures and medical-surgical nursing describe care concepts in other settings. They are not automatic authority to perform the same procedure in BC EMS.
临床程序与内外科护理介绍其他场景的照护概念，但不会自动授权在BC EMS执行同一操作。

00:00:38.088 --> 00:00:48.288
Pharmacology explains what uterine-motility classes do and why monitoring matters; it does not turn a textbook drug table into a PCP medication card.
药理学解释子宫活动药物类别作用及监测理由，但不能把教材药表变成PCP用药卡。

00:00:48.288 --> 00:01:15.072
The actual course-folder Anatomy and Physiology second edition resolves this row: printed pages 1185 to 1216 and 1223 to 1266 map to physical pages 1201 to 1232 and 1239 to 1282. All seventy-six literal pages and the ten named section concepts have now been reviewed. The older candidate export had different pagination.
实际课程文件夹的A&P第二版已解决本行定位：印刷页1185至1216及1223至1266，对应PDF实际1201至1232及1239至1282页。七十六个字面页面及十个具名章节概念现已审阅；旧候选导出版本页码不同。

00:01:15.072 --> 00:01:37.848
The actual FON, MSN, Pharmacology and PMHN course-folder copies were also checked. Read the literal page range alongside the named school topic. Where they point to different material, both must be explained rather than silently replacing one with the other. The separate readers record the actual extent and the remaining source differences.
实际FON、MSN、药理及PMHN课程文件夹副本也已核对。应把字面页码与学校具名主题并列阅读；两者指向不同材料时，两边都要解释，不能悄悄用一边替换另一边。各阅读指南记录实际范围及保留的来源差异。

00:01:37.848 --> 00:02:05.976
The identified 2018 school-folder CPSC copy maps the assigned printed pages six hundred ninety-five through seven hundred twenty-four to intravenous therapy, while its named tracheostomy topic begins at page eight hundred thirty-eight. Both contents have been reviewed and explained. The book is identified; the remaining issue is the school’s literal locator versus named topic, not an unknown adopted edition.
已识别的2018年学校文件夹CPSC版中，指定印刷695至724页对应静脉治疗，具名气切主题则从838页开始。两部分均已审阅讲解。书本已识别；保留问题是学校字面定位与具名主题不同，不是采用版本不明。

00:02:05.976 --> 00:02:17.160
Use each guide as a bilingual learning companion. When its locator differs, verify the chapter and instructor’s copy rather than silently substituting pages.
每份指南都只是双语学习伴读。若定位不一致，应核对章节及教师版本，不能默默换页替代。

00:02:17.160 --> 00:02:29.136
A&P links ovarian function, pregnancy and fetal development. The lesson focuses on how body systems adapt, not a memorized calendar of guaranteed events.
A&P连接卵巢功能、妊娠及胎儿发育；本课关注系统如何适应，而非背诵确定发生的日历。

00:02:29.136 --> 00:02:40.320
Congenital lesions alter pressure and flow in different ways. The same structural label can have variable consequences depending on the defect and developmental stage.
先天性病变会以不同方式改变压力和血流；同一结构名称的后果也随缺损及发育阶段而变。

00:02:40.320 --> 00:02:49.392
Respiratory and reproductive content helps explain why a pregnant patient’s oxygenation, perfusion and airway need integrated assessment.
呼吸及生殖内容帮助解释为何孕妇的氧合、灌注及气道需整合评估。

00:02:49.392 --> 00:02:59.856
Use physiology to decide what question or observation is useful. Do not use a classroom mechanism to diagnose a patient or replace a current local pathway.
应以生理知识决定哪些问题或观察有用，不能用课堂机制诊断患者或替代现行当地路径。

00:02:59.856 --> 00:03:10.128
Children develop skills in a broad sequence, but the timing varies. Age is useful context; it is not a substitute for observing the child in front of you.
儿童技能发展有大致顺序，但时间有个体差异。年龄只是背景，不能替代对眼前儿童的观察。

00:03:10.128 --> 00:03:20.064
A child with intellectual, communication or autism-spectrum differences may need a different way to signal pain, fear, consent or distress.
有智力、沟通或自闭谱系差异的儿童，可能需要不同方式表达疼痛、恐惧、同意或窘迫。

00:03:20.064 --> 00:03:32.208
Ask what communication supports work and what the child usually does. Include the child directly, and invite a caregiver’s observations with the child’s safety and preferences in view.
需询问哪些沟通辅助有效、平时表现如何；应直接与儿童沟通，并结合儿童安全及意愿听取照护者观察。

00:03:32.208 --> 00:03:44.712
Do not assume a diagnosis explains every new symptom, or that distress behavior is voluntary. Look for acute airway, breathing, seizure, injury and perfusion threats.
不能认为诊断能解释所有新症状，也不能假设痛苦行为是故意的；需寻找急性气道、呼吸、抽搐、损伤及灌注威胁。

00:03:44.712 --> 00:04:01.320
The CPSC reader explains the actual school-folder copy’s tracheostomy material and the separate literal intravenous pages. Its identified-copy evidence replaces the earlier candidate-only status, while the genuine page-topic mismatch remains visible.
CPSC读本讲解学校文件夹实际副本的气切内容及另外的字面静脉治疗页。实际副本证据已替换先前仅候选状态，同时保留真实页码主题不符。

00:04:01.320 --> 00:04:11.736
CNS sections also span specimens, anthropometry and cardiopulmonary assessment. They are not three equivalent tracheostomy-procedure sections.
CNS具名章节还涉及标本、人体测量及心肺评估，并非三段可互换的气切操作。

00:04:11.736 --> 00:04:21.408
Suction depth should be related to the actual tube or an individual written plan. Do not borrow a generic fixed distance or push until resistance.
吸引深度应依真实导管或书面个体方案确定，不能照搬通用固定距离或推至阻力处。

00:04:21.408 --> 00:04:31.392
A text can inform your reasoning, but device manipulation and tube replacement require the trained role, current protocol, equipment and supervision.
教材可帮助推理，但器械操作及更换导管需要受训角色、现行规程、设备及监督。

00:04:31.392 --> 00:04:41.736
Oxytocin acts on uterine smooth muscle and is also part of the physiology of milk ejection. The hormone’s roles differ by tissue and context.
催产素作用于子宫平滑肌，也参与乳汁排出；其作用随组织及情境不同。

00:04:41.736 --> 00:04:50.040
Pharmacology texts compare medicines that increase uterine contractions with agents used to slow them in selected circumstances.
药理教材比较促进子宫收缩的药物与特定情况下用于减慢收缩的药物。

00:04:50.040 --> 00:04:59.040
Hospital use can require continuous assessment because overly frequent or sustained contractions may affect maternal and fetal status.
医院使用可能需要持续评估，因为过频或持续收缩可影响母体及胎儿状况。

00:04:59.040 --> 00:05:09.072
The candidate textbook contains dosing tables for clinical settings. They are deliberately not reproduced as an EMS or PCP administration instruction.
候选教材含临床场景剂量表。本课程不会将其复制成EMS或PCP给药指令。

00:05:09.072 --> 00:05:20.256
The school’s saved newborn page says forty to sixty assisted breaths per minute. Current BCEHS M09 text and its linked algorithm specify a different rate.
学校保存的新生儿页面写辅助呼吸每分钟40至60次；现行BCEHS M09正文及其算法给出不同频率。

00:05:20.256 --> 00:05:36.840
BCPEG pages in the saved June 2026 snapshot also use a different compression threshold from current M09/AHA neonatal guidance. The existing newborn lesson labels the conflict and teaches the current local service route.
保存的2026年6月BCPEG页也采用不同于现行M09/AHA新生儿指引的按压门槛；现有新生儿课已标明冲突并教授当地现行服务路径。

00:05:36.840 --> 00:05:48.408
For exam expectations, ask the instructor which revision is assessed while keeping the current clinical distinction visible. Do not merge rates or thresholds into a compromise.
关于考试要求，应向教师核实考核版本，同时保留现行临床差异；不能把频率或阈值折中拼成混合算法。

00:05:48.408 --> 00:06:00.072
The same rule applies to pediatric glucose and device procedures: record age, units, source and scope; never replace uncertainty with a confident-looking number.
儿科血糖及器械程序同理：记录年龄、单位、来源及权限，不能用看似肯定的数字掩盖不确定性。

00:06:00.072 --> 00:06:09.768
Start from the school’s exact chapter and page locator. If the book cover, edition or pagination differs, record that before taking notes.
应从学校指定章节及页码开始；如书名、版本或页码不同，需先记录差异再做笔记。

00:06:09.768 --> 00:06:22.104
For each section, separate a mechanism, a finding, an action concept, a caution and any role boundary. This makes it harder to mistake background theory for a protocol.
每节应拆分机制、发现、行动概念、注意事项及角色界限，避免把背景理论误当规程。

00:06:22.104 --> 00:06:32.880
After reading, explain the point in your own English and Chinese words rather than copying a paragraph. Keep units, dates and qualifiers attached to the claim.
阅读后应用自己的中英文表达概念，不复制整段；单位、日期及限定语需与主张一起保留。

00:06:32.880 --> 00:06:43.752
Test one fresh example, then return to the source to correct your explanation. A bilingual summary is a learning aid, not a substitute for reading the assigned work.
应先用新例测试，再回到原文修正解释；双语摘要是学习辅助，不替代指定阅读。

00:06:43.752 --> 00:06:54.048
A congenital heart disease reading explains structural pathways, shunt direction and changing resistance. Current symptoms still require clinical assessment.
先天性心脏病阅读解释结构路径、分流方向及阻力变化，但当前症状仍需临床评估。

00:06:54.048 --> 00:07:04.080
Developmental and mental-health readings help adapt the questions to the child and identify baseline communication. They do not erase the child’s own report.
发育及精神健康阅读帮助按儿童调整提问并识别沟通基线，但不应抹去儿童本人的表达。

00:07:04.080 --> 00:07:14.184
The real tube, patient-specific plan and trained local procedure determine a safe depth. A candidate nursing source cannot replace that measurement.
真实导管、患者个体方案及当地受训程序决定安全深度；护理候选资料不能替代测量。

00:07:14.184 --> 00:07:25.992
No. A medication table describes pharmacology in its source context. Current service permission, indication, product and provider scope remain separate requirements.
不能。药表描述的是原文场景中的药理；现行服务权限、适应症、产品及提供者范围仍需另行核实。

00:07:25.992 --> 00:07:50.832
The school links four historical articles as well as its module and reading table. Their original bilingual guides are now included here. Use them with the connected weekly lessons: neonatal illness after birth, difficult delivery, pediatric assessment and basic airway support. They are supplementary school readings, not four extra rows in the eleven-row required textbook table.
学校除模块及阅读表外，还链接四篇历史文章。本课现包含其原创中英指南，应连接本周出生后疾病、难产、儿科评估及基础气道支持课学习。它们是学校补充阅读，不是十一行指定教材表新增的四行。

00:07:50.832 --> 00:08:15.960
Read old clinical writing critically. It can explain a mechanism while giving an outdated treatment or an action outside the local role. The guides separate those questions. Learn the reason a finding matters, then apply the current, age-appropriate and authorized pathway; do not memorize an old article’s dose, oxygen target or invasive maneuver as a school-endorsed field order.
旧临床文章应批判阅读：它可解释机制，却同时给出过时治疗或超出当地角色的动作。指南把这些问题分开。先学发现为何重要，再用现行、合年龄及获准路径；不能把旧文药量、氧目标或侵入手法背成学校授权现场医嘱。

00:08:15.960 --> 00:08:43.632
The assigned obstetrical video is now integrated with its original bilingual guide. Follow its clinical sequence into the detailed maternal assessment, delivery, newborn and Apgar lessons. A historical overview can help organize the subject, but it cannot replace the current decision gates or supervised skills practice. The full available English narrative was read; that is not a claim that every demonstrated technique was visually certified.
指定产科视频现已整合进原创中英指南。应沿其临床顺序学习详细母体评估、分娩、新生儿及Apgar课。历史概览可帮助组织主题，但不能取代现行决策条件或受监督技能练习。已通读可取得的英文叙述，不表示每个示范技术都经视觉认证。

00:08:43.632 --> 00:09:13.776
Keep three distinctions explicit. First, a normal pregnancy adaptation does not explain away new deterioration. Second, historical specialist treatments do not create PCP authority. Third, the newborn’s response to effective ventilation comes before the persistent bradycardia compression branch. Use the source-specific guide to identify the old shortcuts, then practise the connected original cases rather than memorize the video’s closing answers.
应明确三个区别：正常妊娠适应不能解释掉新恶化；历史专科治疗不产生PCP权限；新生儿需先看有效通气反应，再进入持续心动过缓按压分支。用来源专属指南辨认旧式捷径，再练相连原创病例，不要背视频结尾答案。

00:09:13.776 --> 00:09:49.104
The four theories answer different questions. Erikson concerns psychosocial tasks and relationships; Piaget concerns ways of thinking; Kohlberg concerns the reasoning used to judge right and wrong; Freud proposes historical psychosexual stages and personality structures. Learn the names, sequence and explanatory purpose, then apply them modestly. They are frameworks to improve questions and support, not tests that classify a patient as successful, morally inferior, incapable of consent or permanently damaged.
四种理论回答不同问题：Erikson关注心理社会任务和关系，Piaget关注思维方式，Kohlberg关注判断对错的理由，Freud提出历史性的心理性发展阶段和人格结构。要学会名称、顺序及解释目的，再谨慎用于提问和支持。它们不是把患者判为成功、道德低下、无同意能力或永久受损的测试。

00:09:49.104 --> 00:10:27.576
Concrete operational thinking, approximately seven to eleven in this source, supports logical reasoning about tangible events. Conservation means that reshaping an equal amount does not change its quantity; reversibility means mentally undoing a process; decentering means considering more than one aspect or perspective. Formal operational thinking, described from about twelve onward, permits hypothetical and abstract reasoning. Stress, familiarity and individual development influence performance. Neither age nor performance on one example establishes decision-making capacity.
来源把具体运算思维大致放在七至十一岁，指对具体事件进行逻辑推理。守恒表示同一数量改变形状后数量不变；可逆性表示能在头脑中逆转过程；去中心化表示能考虑不止一个方面或视角。约十二岁以后描述的形式运算思维，可处理假设及抽象推理。压力、熟悉程度和个体发展都会影响表现，年龄或单次例题表现都不能决定决策能力。

00:10:27.576 --> 00:11:04.728
Vaccination is administration of a vaccine; immunization is the process of gaining protection. In active immunity, the person generates an immune response and memory; passive protection supplies antibodies made elsewhere, such as maternal antibodies or an immunoglobulin product. Antigen and antibody are not synonyms: one is a recognized target, the other a specific immune protein. Protection depends on the product, host and time, so neither breastfeeding nor a vaccination record guarantees that an unwell child cannot have an infection.
疫苗接种vaccination是给予疫苗，免疫形成immunization则是获得保护的过程。主动免疫由本人产生免疫应答和记忆；被动保护则获得外部已制成的抗体，例如母体抗体或免疫球蛋白产品。抗原与抗体不能混用：前者是被识别的目标，后者是特异性免疫蛋白。保护程度依产品、宿主和时间而变，母乳喂养或接种记录都不能保证生病儿童不可能感染。

00:11:04.728 --> 00:11:47.184
Before planned vaccination, verify the actual product, history, dose schedule, contraindications, prior reactions and consent; explain expected effects and serious warning signs. A catch-up plan is product- and history-specific. The textbook US rule requiring guardian consent for every non-emancipated minor must not replace BC assessment of the particular young person and decision. Local mature-minor conditions may permit the child to consent. Concerns about access, cost, fear or trust deserve accurate information and practical support, not punishment or withdrawal of unrelated care.
计划接种前，核对实际产品、病史、剂次安排、禁忌、既往反应及同意，并解释常见反应和严重警讯。补种方案取决于产品及既往接种史。教材要求所有未获法律独立身份的未成年人均由监护人同意的美国规则，不能替代BC对实际儿童及具体决定的评估；符合当地成熟未成年人条件时，儿童可能自行同意。对于可及性、费用、恐惧或信任的担忧，应提供准确信息和实际支持，而非惩罚或撤回无关照护。

00:11:47.184 --> 00:12:30.600
Havighurst adds developmental tasks influenced by maturation, social expectations and personal values. The source six stages are infancy/early childhood zero to six, later childhood six to thirteen, adolescence thirteen to eighteen, early adulthood eighteen to thirty, middle age thirty to sixty and later maturity sixty onward. Examples progress from walking, language and self-care to peer skills, values, work, relationships, contribution and adapting to change. Its historical gender-role, marriage and family assumptions are not compulsory healthy-life requirements or a way to judge disability or culture.
Havighurst强调受身体成熟、社会期望及个人价值影响的发育任务。来源六阶段为零至六岁的婴幼儿早期、六至十三岁儿童后期、十三至十八岁青春期、十八至三十岁成年早期、三十至六十岁中年及六十岁以后的成熟后期。任务例子由走路、语言和自理，发展到同伴技能、价值、工作、关系、贡献及适应变化。其历史性的性别角色、婚姻和家庭假设，不是健康人生的强制要求，也不能用来评价残障或文化。

00:12:30.600 --> 00:13:08.376
Original integration: a school-age child who usually explains symptoms clearly now gives short answers, sits apart and has new rapid breathing. A peer conflict and an established learning difficulty may be relevant, but neither explains away altered interaction or breathing. Start with the physiological assessment and required support, adapt questions to the child, obtain attributed caregiver history and reassess response. Later prevention and referral can address the wider context. The developmental framework helps the assessment; it must not replace it.
原创整合：一名平时能清楚描述症状的学龄儿童，现在只简短回答、独坐，并新出现快速呼吸。同伴冲突及原有学习困难可能相关，但都不能解释掉互动或呼吸变化。先做生理评估和必要支持，再按儿童调整问题，取得注明来源的照顾者病史，并复评反应。之后的预防及转诊可处理更广背景。发育框架应帮助评估，不能取代评估。

00:13:08.376 --> 00:13:43.200
Oxytocin selectively promotes uterine smooth-muscle contraction, increasing rhythmic activity and tone. In the breast, it helps milk ejection by contracting myoepithelial cells; that is not the same as milk production. The expected effect must match the indication: labor contraction and postpartum uterine hemostasis are different clinical settings. A drug name alone does not identify the route, concentration or current order. An administered uterotonic does not eliminate the need to assess ongoing bleeding and perfusion.
催产素选择性促进子宫平滑肌收缩，增加节律性活动及张力。在乳房，它通过肌上皮细胞收缩帮助排乳，这不同于制造乳汁。预期作用要符合指征：产程宫缩与产后子宫止血属于不同临床场景。单凭药名不能确定途径、浓度或当前医嘱。已经用了宫缩剂，也不能免除对持续失血及灌注的评估。

00:13:43.200 --> 00:14:27.000
Unit exercise, not a treatment order: if a simulation label contains 10 units in 1000 mL, it contains 0.01 unit per milliliter, or 10 milliunits per milliliter. If that simulation supplies a verified 1 milliunit per minute order, dividing 1 by 10 gives 0.1 milliliter per minute, equivalent to 6 milliliters per hour. Units, milliunits, milliliters and minutes are different quantities; confusing units with milliunits creates a thousandfold error. The calculation does not select a clinical dose, diluent, pump program or indication. Verify the actual product and independently check the authorized plan.
单位练习，不是治疗医嘱：若模拟标签写10单位配于1000mL，则为0.01单位/mL，也就是10毫单位/mL。若模拟题另外明确给出已核实的1毫单位/分钟医嘱，1除以10得0.1mL/分钟，相当于6mL/小时。单位、毫单位、毫升和分钟是不同量，单位与毫单位混淆会造成一千倍错误。这个计算不选择临床剂量、稀释液、泵程序或指征，仍需核实实际产品并独立复核获准方案。

00:14:27.000 --> 00:15:09.768
Magnesium depresses neuromuscular activity; excessive effect can appear as weakness, reduced reflexes, reduced consciousness, hypotension or inadequate breathing. Renal impairment can increase accumulation, and other depressant medicines can complicate assessment. The fetus or newborn can also be affected. Follow the actual monitoring and escalation plan rather than calling quietness successful treatment. Calcium is a specialist countermeasure for significant toxicity, not an independent PCP dose derived here. Assess and support the actual airway, breathing and circulation while urgently communicating the suspected problem.
镁抑制神经肌肉活动，作用过强可表现为无力、反射减弱、意识降低、低血压或呼吸不足。肾功能受损可增加蓄积，其他抑制性药物也会使判断复杂；胎儿或新生儿同样可能受影响。应遵循真实监测和升级方案，不能把安静称作治疗成功。钙剂是明显毒性时的专科应对，不是本指南提供的PCP独立剂量。应评估并支持实际气道、呼吸与循环，同时紧急沟通疑似问题。

00:15:09.768 --> 00:15:50.712
Original transfer case: a postpartum patient receiving a reported magnesium infusion becomes quieter, weaker and has shallower breathing. Quietness does not prove seizure prevention is safely achieved, and the medicine is not the only possible cause. Reassess airway, ventilation, circulation and responsiveness; verify the actual bag, concentration, pump history and units, and alert the responsible clinical team urgently. Provide indicated support within the actual emergency plan. Do not independently escalate an infusion or diagnose toxicity only from the drug name.
原创转运情境：一名据报正在输注镁的产后患者变得更安静、更无力，呼吸也变浅。安静不证明已安全达到预防抽搐目的，药物也不是唯一可能原因。应重新评估气道、通气、循环和反应，核实真实液袋、浓度、泵记录及单位，并紧急通知责任临床团队。应依真实急救方案提供有指征支持，不能独立增加输注，也不能只凭药名诊断毒性。

00:15:50.712 --> 00:16:27.048
Expressive communication sends meaning; receptive communication receives and understands it. A child who cannot speak clearly may understand a great deal, while fluent speech does not guarantee understanding. Ask one concrete question, allow processing time, and offer the child's own effective method: speech, gesture, writing, pictures or a communication device. Check understanding by asking the child to show or explain the next step. Do not treat a communication aid as evidence that the child cannot decide or feel pain.
表达性沟通传出意义，接受性沟通接收并理解意义。说话不清楚的儿童可能理解很多；说得流利也不保证已经理解。应一次问一个具体问题，留出处理时间，并提供本人有效方式：言语、手势、书写、图片或沟通设备。可以让儿童示范或说明下一步，以核实理解。不能因使用辅助沟通，就认为本人不能决定或感觉不到痛。

00:16:27.048 --> 00:17:06.576
Sensory input and uncertainty can make an assessment overwhelming: touch, alarms, bright light, crowds or a sudden change may matter. Ask the child and caregiver what usually helps, reduce avoidable stimulation and explain before touching. Repetitive movement may help self-regulation rather than represent deliberate disruption. Support a preferred communication method and acknowledge strengths without assuming every autistic child has the same talent. These adaptations accompany assessment of breathing, perfusion, injury and other new illness; they do not replace it.
感觉输入及不确定性可能使评估难以承受：触碰、警报、强光、人群或突然变化都可能重要。应问儿童和照护者平时什么有帮助，减少可避免刺激，并在触碰前解释。重复动作可能帮助自我调节，不是故意捣乱。要支持偏好沟通方式，承认优势，但不能认为所有自闭儿童都有相同天赋。这些调整应与呼吸、灌注、损伤及新疾病评估同时进行，而不是替代评估。

00:17:06.576 --> 00:17:40.680
Motor tics are repeated movements; vocal tics are repeated sounds. Tourette syndrome involves a history of multiple motor tics and at least one vocal tic, with a course lasting at least a year and onset before eighteen; the motor and vocal tics need not occur together. Persistent motor or vocal tic disorder involves one type rather than both; provisional tic disorder has a shorter course. These distinctions describe formal assessment, not diagnosis by one observed twitch. Coprolalia is not required.
运动性抽动为重复动作，发声性抽动为重复声音。Tourette综合征涉及多种运动性抽动和至少一种发声性抽动病史，病程至少一年且十八岁前起病；两者不必同时出现。持续性运动或发声抽动障碍涉及其中一类而不是两类；暂时性抽动障碍病程较短。这些区别用于正式评估，不是凭一次抽动下诊断，秽语也不是必需条件。

00:17:40.680 --> 00:18:18.432
Original case: a twelve-year-old who usually uses short spoken phrases begins repeatedly turning away and pushing an assessment hand aside. A familiar caregiver reports this is new and the child is less responsive than usual. Reduce noise, explain one step and retain the child's communication support, while promptly assessing airway, breathing, perfusion, responsiveness and other indicated causes. Document the change and response. A developmental label does not explain the new decline, and forcing eye contact does not establish that the child is safe.
原创情境：一名平时用简短短语的十二岁儿童，开始反复转开并推开评估者的手。熟悉照护者说这是新变化，反应也比平常低。应降低噪音、每次解释一步并保留沟通支持，同时及时评估气道、呼吸、灌注、反应及其他有指征病因。记录变化与处理后反应。发育标签不能解释新恶化，强迫眼神接触也不能证明安全。

00:18:18.432 --> 00:18:57.504
In bronchiectasis, damaged bronchial walls remain abnormally widened. Wider does not mean easier clearance: retained secretions can encourage infection, inflammation and further wall injury, creating a self-reinforcing cycle. The assigned page names cystic fibrosis, ciliary dysfunction, previous infection, immune problems and obstruction among associated causes or risks; some cases are unexplained. Assess the actual history and change, not sex or age stereotypes. A chronic diagnosis does not establish the cause of today's breathlessness.
支气管扩张时，受损支气管壁长期异常扩张。变宽不等于更容易清除：潴留分泌物可促进感染、炎症及进一步管壁损伤，形成互相强化的循环。指定页列出囊性纤维化、纤毛功能异常、既往感染、免疫问题及阻塞等相关原因或风险，也有病因不明者。应评估真实病史和变化，不套性别年龄刻板印象；慢性诊断不能确定今天气促的原因。

00:18:57.504 --> 00:19:34.056
The pneumonia page shows inflammation and alveolar filling reducing the normally open gas-exchange space. Infection and aspiration can both injure lung tissue, but aspiration inflammation is not automatically proof of a bacterial infection needing the same drug. Ask about onset, aspiration risk, fever, secretions, breathing work and clinical trend. Low reserve, fatigue or new reduced responsiveness matters. Explain the mechanism without turning a picture into a diagnosis or delaying indicated respiratory support while waiting for fever.
肺炎页显示，炎症及肺泡内液体占据原本开放的气体交换空间。感染和误吸都能损伤肺组织，但误吸性炎症不自动证明是需同一种药的细菌感染。应问起病、误吸风险、发热、分泌物、呼吸功及临床趋势。储备低、疲劳或新反应下降都重要。图示用于解释机制，不是诊断；不能为了等发热而延误有指征呼吸支持。

00:19:34.056 --> 00:20:16.560
Pelvic symptoms overlap. PID may involve infection-associated pain/discharge; endometriosis often has a cyclical pain history; fibroids may produce bleeding or pressure. These are patterns for reasoning, not mutually exclusive field diagnoses. Ask about timing, bleeding, pregnancy possibility, recent birth/procedures, fever, pain, urinary symptoms, medicines and the person's concerns. Privacy, consent, relevant language and a nonjudgmental explanation improve the history. Acute perfusion or breathing threats take priority over completing an intimate checklist.
盆腔症状互有重叠：盆腔炎可有感染相关疼痛或分泌物，内异症常有周期性疼痛史，肌瘤可产生出血或压迫。它们是推理模式，不是现场互斥诊断。应问时间、出血、妊娠可能、近期分娩或操作、发热、疼痛、泌尿症状、药物及本人担忧。隐私、同意、合适语言及非评判解释有助病史；急性灌注或呼吸威胁优先于完成私密清单。

00:20:16.560 --> 00:20:56.976
Original case: a postpartum patient reports a previous fibroid diagnosis and new heavier bleeding, dizziness and weakness. Do not let the familiar diagnosis settle the cause. Assess current responsiveness, airway, breathing and perfusion; clarify recent birth/procedures, the bleeding trend and the actual treatment plan; provide indicated support and urgent communication. The literal pelvic reading explains overlapping symptoms, while the separate maternal-hemorrhage pathway governs the obstetric response. Improvement must be demonstrated by reassessment, not assumed after an intervention.
原创情境：一名产后患者报告既往肌瘤史，现出血增加、头晕和无力。不能让熟悉诊断替你确定病因。应评估当前反应、气道、呼吸及灌注，澄清近期分娩或操作、出血趋势及真实治疗方案，提供有指征支持并紧急沟通。字面盆腔阅读解释症状重叠，独立产科出血路径指导产科应对。改善必须通过复评证实，不能因为做过干预就假定改善。

00:20:56.976 --> 00:21:30.504
Count chromosome sets separately from DNA copies. A primary gametocyte is diploid; after meiosis I, a secondary gametocyte is already haploid even though each chromosome still has two chromatids. Meiosis II separates those chromatids. Thus a secondary oocyte has twenty-three duplicated chromosomes, not a diploid forty-six-chromosome set. The source prose calls it diploid, but its own figure marks it n. Fertilization normally restores two chromosome sets in the zygote.
染色体组数与DNA拷贝数要分开。初级配子母细胞为二倍体；减数第一次分裂后，次级配子母细胞已经是单倍体，虽然每条染色体仍有两条染色单体。第二次分裂再分开单体。因此次级卵母细胞有二十三条复制过的染色体，不是二倍体四十六条。来源正文称其二倍体，但同页图标为n；正常受精后，合子恢复两套染色体。

00:21:30.504 --> 00:22:08.184
Oogenesis begins before birth. Primary oocytes pause in meiosis I; a selected one completes that division before ovulation and produces a large secondary oocyte plus a small polar body. The secondary oocyte pauses in metaphase II and completes the division after fertilization-related activation. Unequal division retains most cytoplasm in one cell; it does not make four equivalent eggs. Contrast this with four spermatids from one primary spermatocyte, and keep nuclear inheritance separate from mainly oocyte-derived cytoplasm/mitochondria.
卵子发生在出生前开始。初级卵母细胞暂停于减数第一次分裂；选定细胞在排卵前完成该分裂，形成较大次级卵母细胞及较小极体。次级卵母细胞暂停在第二次分裂中期，在受精相关激活后完成分裂。不等分裂把大部分细胞质留在一个细胞中，并不形成四个等价卵子。应与一个初级精母细胞形成四个精子细胞对比，并区分核遗传与主要来自卵母细胞的细胞质或线粒体。

00:22:08.184 --> 00:22:43.848
FSH supports follicular development while ovarian steroids and inhibin influence feedback. Much of the cycle uses negative feedback. Sustained high estradiol near the appropriate pre-ovulatory stage instead promotes positive feedback and the LH surge. LH drives oocyte maturation, follicular rupture and luteinization. After ovulation, progesterone and estrogen from the corpus luteum support the endometrium and suppress another immediate recruitment cycle. A model's day fourteen is not a guaranteed ovulation date.
FSH支持卵泡发育，卵巢类固醇及抑制素参与反馈。周期大部分时间为负反馈；适当排卵前阶段持续高雌二醇，转而促进正反馈及LH峰。LH推动卵母细胞成熟、卵泡破裂及黄体化。排卵后，黄体孕酮与雌激素支持内膜并抑制立即再启动新周期。模型中的第十四天不是保证的排卵日。

00:22:43.848 --> 00:23:19.176
Match the two clocks: ovarian follicular phase overlaps uterine menstruation and proliferation; ovarian luteal phase overlaps uterine secretion. Estrogen helps rebuild the functional endometrium; progesterone supports its secretory state and vascular preparation. Without pregnancy-support signaling, luteal regression lowers steroid support and the functional layer is shed. Menarche is the first menstrual bleeding, but it is not a guarantee that every early cycle is ovulatory or that pregnancy was impossible before that first bleed.
要对应两套时钟：卵巢卵泡期与子宫月经期及增殖期重叠，黄体期与子宫分泌期重叠。雌激素帮助重建功能内膜，孕酮支持分泌状态及血管准备。缺少妊娠维持信号时，黄体退化、激素支持下降，功能层脱落。初潮是第一次月经出血，不保证每个早期周期都排卵，也不证明初次出血之前绝不可能妊娠。

00:23:19.176 --> 00:23:57.864
Maternal blood normally flows around placental villi while fetal blood stays in villous vessels; exchange occurs across tissue interfaces. Normal separation is not an absolute ban on cell transfer. Fetal red cells can enter maternal circulation and sensitization can matter, including after prior pregnancy events or other exposures. Risk depends on antibodies and exposure history, not birth order alone. Rh status, relevant events and prior prevention belong in clinical history and specialist follow-up, not an independently selected prophylaxis schedule here.
母体血通常流经胎盘绒毛周围，胎儿血在绒毛血管内，物质跨组织界面交换。正常分隔不表示绝无细胞转移；胎儿红细胞可进入母体循环，既往妊娠事件或其他暴露后的致敏也可重要。风险取决于抗体及暴露史，而不只看胎次。Rh状态、相关事件与既往预防应纳入病史及专科随访，这里不自行选定预防用药时间表。

00:23:57.864 --> 00:24:26.640
The umbilical vein brings relatively oxygen-rich blood from the placenta toward the fetus. Some flow passes through the liver and some through the ductus venosus toward the inferior vena cava. The foramen ovale connects right and left atria; the ductus arteriosus connects the pulmonary arterial pathway to the aorta. These shunts distribute flow around a high-resistance lung circuit; they do not mean the fetal liver receives no meaningful blood flow.
脐静脉把相对富氧血从胎盘带向胎儿，一部分流经肝脏，另一部分经静脉导管进入下腔静脉。卵圆孔连接右、左心房；动脉导管连接肺动脉通路与主动脉。分流帮助血液绕开高阻力肺循环，并不表示胎肝没有重要血流。

00:24:26.640 --> 00:25:03.600
Pregnancy increases blood volume, cardiac workload and ventilation, while vascular and mechanical changes alter the examination. Do not copy the source claim that blood pressure must rise or each inspiration becomes smaller: pressure can fall in mid-pregnancy, and tidal volume/minute ventilation generally increase despite reduced functional residual capacity. Reduced reserve helps explain rapid respiratory deterioration. Severe headache, new breathlessness, bleeding, syncope or poor perfusion still requires assessment rather than being called normal pregnancy.
妊娠增加血容量、心脏负荷和通气，血管及机械改变也影响检查。不能照搬来源认为血压必然升高或每次吸气变小的说法：孕中期血压可下降；尽管功能残气量减少，潮气量和每分钟通气通常增加。储备减少有助解释为何呼吸可迅速恶化。严重头痛、新气促、出血、晕厥或灌注差，仍需评估，不能直接称正常妊娠。

00:25:03.600 --> 00:25:37.632
Original synthesis: at a birth rehearsal, one learner says 'umbilical artery means oxygen-rich', another says 'all shunts close permanently with the first breath', and a third wants to wait for an Apgar total before supporting poor breathing. Correct the chain: name vessels by direction, trace placental gas exchange and the three shunts, explain gradual pressure/flow transition, and act on the newborn's actual breathing/heart rate through the current pathway. Keep a separate maternal reassessment running throughout.
原创综合练习：分娩演练中，一人说脐动脉就是富氧，另一人说第一口气后所有分流永久关闭，第三人想等Apgar总分后再支持差的呼吸。应依次纠正：血管按方向命名，追踪胎盘交换与三条分流，解释压力血流逐渐转变，并按当前路径依据实际呼吸心率行动。全过程同时保留独立的母体复评。

00:25:37.632 --> 00:26:13.416
Meiosis segregates alleles into gametes. In a simple complete-dominance model, cross two heterozygotes, each carrying one capital-G allele and one lowercase-g allele. The possibilities are two capital alleles, two mixed combinations, or two lowercase alleles. The genotype ratio is one to two to one; with complete dominance, the phenotype ratio is three to one. Independent assortment has linkage exceptions. These are probabilities for each conception, not a required order or exact number of affected children.
孟德尔模型追踪等位基因分离进入配子，再于受精组合。简单完全显性Gg与Gg模型有GG、Gg、gG及gg：基因型为一比二比一；若G完全显性，表型为三比一。独立分配有重要连锁例外。概率描述符合假设的每一次受孕，不保证四个孩子必须恰好一个受影响。

00:26:13.416 --> 00:26:48.264
In a simplified X-linked model, an XY parent's X goes to XX offspring and the Y to XY offspring, so an X-linked variant is not transmitted father-to-son by that X. With a heterozygous XX parent and an unaffected XY parent, each child has a one-half chance of receiving the variant-bearing maternal X; the consequence depends on the child's chromosomes and the disorder. Do not turn the source's 'unaffected carrier' simplification into a clinical rule: females with hemophilia-related variants can bleed.
简化X连锁模型中，XY亲本的X传给XX后代，Y传给XY后代，因此该X上的变异不按父子方式传递。杂合XX亲本与未受影响XY亲本组合，每个孩子有二分之一机会获得带变异的母源X，后果取决于孩子染色体与具体疾病。不能把来源未受影响携带者的简化变成临床规则；携带血友病相关变异的女性也可能出血。

00:26:48.264 --> 00:27:24.072
Use the complete Chapter Six reading to trace blood through each connection. An atrial or ventricular septal defect can add pulmonary flow and volume load; the amount depends on the defect and relative resistance. Coarctation obstructs systemic outflow and can threaten lower-body perfusion. Tetralogy combines outflow obstruction, a ventricular septal defect, an overriding aorta and right-ventricular hypertrophy. Describe pressure and direction rather than assuming every congenital lesion has the same cyanosis or saturation.
用完整第六章阅读追踪每条连接。房间隔或室间隔缺损可增加肺血流及容量负荷，程度取决于缺损与相对阻力。主动脉缩窄阻碍体循环流出，可危及下半身灌注。法洛四联症结合流出梗阻、室间隔缺损、主动脉骑跨及右室肥厚。应描述压力与方向，不能认为全部先天病都有相同发绀或血氧。

00:27:24.072 --> 00:27:55.680
An infant who initially appeared well can deteriorate as transitional circulation changes. Compare feeding, breathing effort, alertness and limb perfusion with the actual baseline. Cyanosis is not required before a major defect becomes dangerous, and an isolated murmur or weak pulse cannot establish anatomy. Assess immediate threats and use the current pediatric support and escalation pathway while keeping infection and respiratory causes in the differential.
过渡循环改变时，起初看似良好的婴儿也可恶化。应将喂养、呼吸功、清醒度及肢体灌注与实际基线比较。重大缺陷危险时未必先出现发绀，孤立杂音或弱脉也不能确定解剖。应评估即时威胁，使用当前儿科支持及升级路径，同时保留感染及呼吸原因。

00:27:55.680 --> 00:28:32.328
The complete chapter includes eight defect sections, not only the familiar five names. In d-transposition, the two circuits run in parallel and effective mixing is essential. A patent ductus can cause excess pulmonary flow in one lesion yet support mixing or systemic supply in another. Complete AV canal combines atrial and ventricular defects with an abnormal common atrioventricular junction and valve. Truncus arteriosus has one arterial outlet, with flow distribution and possible valve leakage adding to the burden.
完整章节包含八类缺陷，不只是熟悉的五个名称。d型大动脉转位中两循环并联，需要有效混合。开放动脉导管在某病变可造成肺血流过多，在另一病变又可支持混合或体循环供应。完全房室间隔缺损结合房室间隔缺损与异常共同房室连接及瓣膜。永存动脉干只有一个动脉出口，血流分配及可能瓣膜漏进一步增加负担。

00:28:32.328 --> 00:29:02.424
For retrieval, contrast a large ventricular shunt with parallel circulation, then explain why an open duct is not universally good or bad. Ask about the actual diagnosis, operations, medicines and usual observations without inventing a target. Maintaining or closing a duct is specialist care, not a new PCP drug instruction. Hand over the deterioration and the evidence instead of delaying support to obtain a perfect anatomical label.
提取时，比较较大室间分流与并联循环，再解释为何导管开放不能一概好或坏。应询问真实诊断、手术、药物及平时观察，不编造目标。维持或关闭导管属于专科照护，不是新增PCP药物指令。应交接恶化及证据，不能为追求完美解剖名称而延误支持。
